			</Placemark>
			<Placemark id="5983403BE200001B">
				<name>TERRY BRITT&apos;S</name>
				<description><![CDATA[<b>Location detail:</b> Four miles south of Yellow Springs Church. <b>[cite: 491]</b><br/>
      <b>Investigation:</b> Described as the "geographic center" of where evidence was recovered. <b>[cite: 791]</b><br/>
      <b>Action:</b> Wiretaps and search warrants executed here. <b>[cite: 492-493]</b><br/>
      <b>Notes:</b> Coordinate may reflect later mapping/property-record work; court text provides relative location.<br/>
      <b>Source:</b> 2022 appellate opinion (State v. Zachary Rye Adams), line refs above
      ]]></description>
