				<description><![CDATA[<b>Identity:</b> Defendant's grandfather. <b>[cite: 91]</b><br/>
      <b>Location detail:</b> Located on the same property as the Defendant's home. <b>[cite: 91]</b><br/>
      <b>Testimony:</b> The victim's mother visited here in July 2011. <b>[cite: 90-91]</b><br/>
      <b>Source:</b> 2022 appellate opinion (State v. Zachary Rye Adams), line refs above
